  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "創業與創新",
    "sub_ename": "ENTREPRENEURSHIP AND INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "創業與創新是創造財富的新經濟的關鍵推動力。它已成為國家重大重點經濟發展在許多國家，包括台灣在內。例如，以色列，700萬人口的國家聲稱自己是一個“啟動的國家”，在NASDEQ上市多於世界上任何其他國家的63以色列的公司（2009年）。\r\n本課程旨在以講座，論壇，並在體驗動手了豐富的組合，以鼓勵學生將通過創造新的商業的思維過程。學生將被安排在團隊中分享他們的背景，經驗，知識和網絡。",
    "describe_eh": "Entrepreneurship with innovation is the key driving force in creating wealth for new economy. It has become major national thrust for economic development in many countries including Taiwan. For example, Israel, a country of 7 million people has claimed themselves as a “start up nation” with 63 Israel companies (in 2009) listed in NASDEQ more than those of any other nations around the world. \r\nThis course is designed with a rich mix of lectures, discussion forums, and hands on experience to encourage students going through the thought process of creating new business. Students will be organized in teams to share their background, experience, knowledge and networks.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "協助學生了解與培養「創業家精神」",
      "describe_en": "To help students understand and develop \"Entrepreneurship\"."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "介紹工程科學創新如何轉變成商業化的基礎知識",
      "describe_en": "Introduces the fundamentals of how engineering science innovations translate into commercialization."
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "describe_ch": "藉由系統思考的思維協助學生具備解決複雜問題的能力",
      "describe_en": "Assist students with the ability to solve complex problems through systematic thinking."
    }
  ],
